---
import SectionHead from "./shared/SectionHead.astro";
---

<section id="founders" class="px-[5vw] py-28">
  <SectionHead
    tag="The Visionaries"
    title={[
      { text: "Meet Our", highlight: false },
      { text: "Founders", highlight: true },
    ]}
    description="Three decades of combined mastery, united by a singular obsession — creating spaces that endure beyond their time."
  />

  <div class="mt-[4.5rem] grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <!-- Founder -->
    <div class="founder-card reveal relative">
      <div
        class="relative mb-7 h-[480px] overflow-hidden bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat"
        style='
              background-image: url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472099645785-5658abf4ff4e?w=600&q=85");
            '
      >
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-3 z-[2] border border-[rgba(201,169,110,0.3)] transition-colors duration-400"
        >
        </div>

        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] bg-[linear-gradient(to_top,rgba(8,7,6,0.7)_0%,transparent_50%)]"
        >
        </div>

        <div
          class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 z-[3] flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#c9a96e] before:block before:h-px before:w-5 before:bg-[#c9a96e] before:content-['']"
        >
          Founder & CEO
        </div>
      </div>

      <p
        class="mb-1 font-['Cormorant_Garamond'] text-[1.6rem] font-normal tracking-[0.03em] text-[#f5f0e8]"
      >
        Sandeep Kumar A
      </p>

      <p class="mb-3 text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#c9a96e]">
        Founder & Chief Executive
      </p>

      <div class="mb-3 h-px w-[30px] bg-[#c9a96e]"></div>

      <p class="text-[0.8rem] leading-[1.9] text-[#8a8070]">
        With over 22 years in luxury construction, Arjun founded AURUM with a
        vision to redefine architectural excellence in India. A graduate of IIT
        Delhi and Harvard GSD, he has led projects across three continents.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Founder -->
    <div class="founder-card reveal relative" style="transition-delay: 0.3s">
      <div
        class="relative mb-7 h-[480px] overflow-hidden bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat"
        style='
              background-image: url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1472099645785-5658abf4ff4e?w=600&q=85");
            '
      >
        <div
          class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-3 z-[2] border border-[rgba(201,169,110,0.3)] transition-colors duration-400"
        >
        </div>

        <div
          class="absolute inset-0 z-[1] bg-[linear-gradient(to_top,rgba(8,7,6,0.7)_0%,transparent_50%)]"
        >
        </div>

        <div
          class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 z-[3] flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.6rem] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#c9a96e] before:block before:h-px before:w-5 before:bg-[#c9a96e] before:content-['']"
        >
          Principal Architect
        </div>
      </div>

      <p
        class="mb-1 font-['Cormorant_Garamond'] text-[1.6rem] font-normal tracking-[0.03em] text-[#f5f0e8]"
      >
        Giri Prasad Goud
      </p>

      <p class="mb-3 text-[0.7rem] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#c9a96e]">
        Founder & Principal Architect
      </p>

      <div class="mb-3 h-px w-[30px] bg-[#c9a96e]"></div>

      <p class="text-[0.8rem] leading-[1.9] text-[#8a8070]">
        Rajan's structural ingenuity transforms the most ambitious blueprints
        into built reality. An alumnus of SPA New Delhi and the AA London, his
        award-winning designs have set new benchmarks for modern luxury.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
